<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#1a237e">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/icon-192.png">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        .stat-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff, #f8f9fa);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        .stat-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }
        .graph-container {
            background: white;
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            max-width: 100%;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }
        .graph-container img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 5px;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .graph-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .graph-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
        .highlight {
            color: #1a237e;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .pie-chart-container {
            max-width: 400px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
            width: 90%;
        }
    </style>
<body>
    <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a>
        <a href="/python-report"><i class="fab fa-python"></i> Python</a>
        <a href="/java-report"><i class="fab fa-java"></i> Java</a>
        <a href="/powerbi-report"><i class="fas fa-chart-bar"></i> Power BI</a>
        <a href="/azure-report"><i class="fas fa-cloud"></i> Azure</a>
        <a href="/ai-report" class="active"><i class="fas fa-brain"></i> AI</a>
        <a href="/calendar"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i> Calendar</a>
        <a href="/curriculum"><i class="fas fa-book"></i> Curriculum</a>
    </div>

    <div class="header">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 class="display-4">Microsoft Azure AI-900 Fundamentals Exam Results Report</h1>
            <p class="lead">Performance Analysis of 100 Students</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Introduction -->
        <div class="card mb-4 p-4">
            <h2>Introduction</h2>
            <p>This report analyzes the performance of 100 students in the Microsoft Azure AI-900 Fundamentals certification exam. The data includes first attempt scores, retake scores where applicable, and overall performance metrics. The analysis aims to identify trends, strengths, and areas for improvement to enhance future student preparation.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Key Statistics -->
        <div class="row mb-4">
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="card stat-card p-3">
                    <h3 class="h5">Total Students</h3>
                    <p class="display-6">100</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="card stat-card p-3">
                    <h3 class="h5">Average Score</h3>
                    <p class="display-6">871</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="card stat-card p-3">
                    <h3 class="h5">Highest Score</h3>
                    <p class="display-6">985</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="card stat-card p-3">
                    <h3 class="h5">Pass Rate</h3>
                    <p class="display-6">96.0%</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Data Summary -->
        <div class="card mb-4 p-4">
            <h2>Data Summary</h2>
            <ul class="list-unstyled">
                <li><strong>Highest Score (First Attempt):</strong> 985 (Bophelo Sihlangu)</li>
                <li><strong>Lowest Score (First Attempt):</strong> 667 (Mpho Selemela)</li>
                <li><strong>Students Who Did Not Write:</strong> 8</li>
                <li><strong>Students Who Rescheduled:</strong> 2</li>
                <li><strong>Students Who Failed First Attempt:</strong> 3</li>
                <li><strong>Students Who Passed Retake:</strong> 2</li>
                <li><strong>Students Who Failed Retake:</strong> 1</li>
                <li><strong>Students Who Did Not Retake:</strong> 2</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Visualizations -->
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-12">
                <div class="graph-container">
                    <h3 class="h4">Individual Student Scores</h3>
                    <img src="/images/ai_bar_chart.png" alt="Bar Chart of Individual Student Scores">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="graph-container">
                    <h3 class="h4">Score Distribution</h3>
                    <img src="/images/ai_histogram.png" alt="Histogram of Score Distribution">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="graph-container">
                    <h3 class="h4">Score Categories</h3>
                    <img src="/images/ai_pie_chart.png" alt="Pie Chart of Score Categories">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="graph-container">
                    <h3 class="h4">First vs Second Attempt Comparison</h3>
                    <img src="/images/ai_comparison.png" alt="Comparison of First and Second Attempts">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6">
                <!-- Statistical Analysis -->
                <div class="card mb-4 p-4">
                    <h2>Statistical Analysis</h2>
                    
                    <h3 class="mt-4">First Attempt Analysis</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Total Students: 100</li>
                        <li>Students who Wrote: 90</li>
                        <li>Pass Rate: 96.7%</li>
                        <li>Average Score: 871.26</li>
                        <li>Median Score: 885</li>
                        <li>Standard Deviation: 68.73</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h3 class="mt-4">Score Distribution</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>900-1000: 15 students (16.7%)</li>
                        <li>800-899: 45 students (50.0%)</li>
                        <li>700-799: 27 students (30.0%)</li>
                        <li>Below 700: 3 students (3.3%)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Key Findings -->
        <div class="card mb-4 p-4">
            <h2>Key Findings</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Initial pass rate of <span class="highlight">95.9%</span> for first attempts</li>
                <li>High success rate in retakes with <span class="highlight">66.7%</span> passing</li>
                <li>Strong overall pass rate of <span class="highlight">96.0%</span></li>
                <li>Highest score achieved: <span class="highlight">985</span> by Bophelo Sihlangu</li>
                <li>Lowest score: <span class="highlight">667</span> by Mpho Selemela</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Recommendations -->
        <div class="card mb-4 p-4">
            <h2>Recommendations</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Recognize top performer Bophelo Sihlangu for the outstanding score of 985</li>
                <li>Follow up with students who did not retake (Kamogelo Nonyane, Skhumbuzo Mabasa)</li>
                <li>Investigate why some students did not write or rescheduled their first attempt</li>
                <li>Enhance preparation resources for students requiring retakes</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="bg-light py-3 mt-5">
        <div class="container text-center">
            <p class="text-muted mb-0">Report Generated by Andre Snell, Senior Facilitator • March 2025</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
